{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the shadows with the Dark Fantasy #1 Pack for Color A Cube!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world of myth and mystery with this darkly enchanting DLC. The Dark Fantasy #1 Pack adds 10 intricately crafted, paintable voxel models inspired by twisted legends and eerie magic. From fallen heroes to cursed relics, each model invites you to explore the dark side of creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde1 Dark Knight \u2013 1,582 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9 Necromancer \u2013 1,010 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 Undead Monarch \u2013 1,324 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea Bottle of Poison \u2013 296 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7c Fallen Angel \u2013 844 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9 Dark Elf \u2013 534 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Corrupted Forest Spirit \u2013 1,396 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc09 Dragon Head \u2013 2,234 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Embers of Solitude \u2013 1,296 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd6f Candelabra \u2013 644 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re illuminating a candelabra in flickering ghostlight or bringing cursed armor to life, this pack is perfect for fans of gothic tales, dark fantasy, and hauntingly beautiful voxel art. Add a touch of darkness to your Color A Cube collection!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792050?t=1751009234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792050?t=1751009234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792050/fbdfa117a9331cd8484b6b9a106347bebc043567/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751009234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset